Error [E0763]: `/` comes after `*` in this parameter list
  --> tests/ui/param_zone_misplaced.jet:1:47
    |
  1 | fn connect(host: String, *, timeout: Int{30}, /, tls: Bool{true}) String -> "{host}"
    |                                               ^
 Why: The zones read left to right: positional-only, then either, then label-only
 Fix: Move `/` before `*`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0763
